+# Desk reference
+
+## Reading history
+
+Revisions are listed newest first within a post. Draft saves update the post
+without adding a snapshot.
+
+## Missed build
+
+A failed hook undoes the publish. The author should publish the post again.
+
+Open the site's hosting dashboard and check its queue for this publication.
+If a build for it is queued or running, stop and follow that build. Otherwise
+trigger one rebuild from the host dashboard. Publishing again creates another
+revision.
+
+The [receipt from Acme's release](../receipts/hook-17.txt) is the record used
+when support reviews that release.
