+# Maintenance decisions
+
+## Engineering manual
+
+Accepted by the maintainers. Migrate the published engineering manual in
+`docs/` to the Open Knowledge Format and update its references in the checkout.
+The editor handling the migration may make these edits and submit the
+result for review. Application changes are outside this decision.
+
+For the next export we may retire `specs/index.md`, `specs/post-records.md`,
+`guides/index.md` and `deploy-hooks.md`, including their bookmarks, once
+their current references in the repository reach the appropriate new owners.
+The same decision covers `guides/desk.md#desk-reference` and
+`guides/desk.md#reading-history`. Keep `guides/desk.md#missed-build` working
+for the printed support card. Other published entries retain their support.
